From 6290d3040de0bce9ed9a21fb57ff9d9bf9b33a90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:44:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 40/58] feat(cli): exclusions in proxmoxbackup-directory (issue
 #4)

-exclude PATTERN (repeatable), -exclude-from FILE and "exclude" /
"exclude-from" in the JSON config, wired to the pxar exclusion matcher the
GUI already uses (ExcludeRoot = the original directory, so absolute patterns
still match under VSS). A missing exclusion file is an error rather than an
unfiltered backup.
